Hi {Owner},

I build websites and software for training institutes and vocational centres around {City}. {Business Name} runs courses people search for by name, but the site lists them in a PDF and enrolling stops at an enquiry form.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting first: a searchable course catalogue with fees and next intakes, an online placement test, enrolment with payment plans, a corporate training page and certificate verification, with marked placeholders where your photos would go. It feeds the student system you already use:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, the build runs {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, intake updates and changes. If not, no problem, the sample comes down at the end of the month.

Worth thirty minutes before your next intake?

